Phone 11 Pro, 256 GB</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-body\">\n<p>Thank you, I did not expect that you would really send me a real iPhone 11 Pro. But when I opened the package, I discovered the original iPhone 11 Pro 256 GB Silver</p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 10/11/2019</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input name=\"review_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"10852\">\n<input name=\"total_review_comments\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\"/>\n<div class=\"review-header\">\n<span class=\"review-author-name\"><div class=\"customer-badge badge-nobadge\"></div>0ddys</span>\n<div class=\"ms-ratings comments\">\n<div class=\"ms-empty-stars\"></div>\n<div class=\"ms-full-stars\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Buyed product: <a class=\"product-name\" href=\"http://deepmexzsejpzqid3k7knaas2p73dko6kxgpou7oey7vqtmrhopjyqyd.onion/products/airpods-2/\">AirPods 2</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-body\">\n<p>Hi, the FedEx courier gave me an order today, I'm happy. I had a birthday yesterday. I made myself a present :)</p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 07/11/2019</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input name=\"review_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"10847\">\n<input name=\"total_review_comments\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\"/>\n<div class=\"review-header\">\n<span class=\"review-author-name\"><div class=\"customer-badge badge-nobadge\"></div>Du$t!n</span>\n<div class=\"ms-ratings comments\">\n<div class=\"ms-empty-stars\"></div>\n<div class=\"ms-full-stars\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Buyed product: <a class=\"product-name\" href=\"http://deepmexzsejpzqid3k7knaas2p73dko6kxgpou7oey7vqtmrhopjyqyd.onion/products/airpods-pro/\">AirPods Pro</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-body\">\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 05/11/2019</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input