-full-stars\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Buyed product: <a class=\"product-name\" href=\"http://deepmexzsejpzqid3k7knaas2p73dko6kxgpou7oey7vqtmrhopjyqyd.onion/products/macbook-pro-15-512gb/\">MacBook Pro 15 Touch Bar and Touch ID; 512GB</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-body\">\n<p>Really work??</p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 13/07/2019</p>\n<div class=\"vendor-response\">\n<p class=\"vr-title\">Seller response:</p>\n<p class=\"vr-body\">Yes of course! He can be yours :)</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input name=\"review_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"7170\">\n<input name=\"total_review_comments\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\"/>\n<div class=\"review-header\">\n<span class=\"review-author-name\"><div class=\"customer-badge badge-nobadge\"></div>Fugitive</span>\n<div class=\"ms-ratings comments\">\n<div class=\"ms-empty-stars\"></div>\n<div class=\"ms-full-stars\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-body\">\n<p>I have been choosing a model for a long time. But it stopped at 13 inches. The parcel came safe!</p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 11/07/2019</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input name=\"review_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"7178\">\n<input name=\"total_review_comments\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\"/>\n<div class=\"review-header\">\n<span class=\"review-author-name\"><div class=\"customer-badge badge-nobadge\"></div>WoodFrozen</span>\n<div class=\"ms-ratings comments\">\n<div class=\"ms-empty-stars\"></div>\n<div class=\"ms-full-stars\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Buyed product: <a class=\"product-name\" href=\"http://deepmexzsejpzqid3k7knaas2p73dko6kxgpou7oey7vqtmrhopjyqyd.onion/products/macbook-pro-13-touch-bar-and-touch-id-512gb/\">MacBook Pro 13 Touch Bar and Touch ID; 512GB</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-body\">\n<p>I thought they would deceive me. But the iStore guys turned out to be honest and sent me a macbook.</p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 09/07/2019</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input name=\"review_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"7174\">\n<input name=\"total_review_comments\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\"/>\n<div class=\"review-header\">\n<span class=\"review-author-name\"><div class=\"customer-badge badge-nobadge\"></div>lilbambi</span>\n<div class=\"ms-ratings comments\">\n<div class=\"ms-empty-stars\"></div>\n<div class=\"ms-full-stars\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Buyed product: <a class=\"product-name\" href=\"http://deepmexzsejpzqid3k7knaas2p73dko6kxgpou7oey7vqtmrhopjyqyd.onion/products/macbook-pro-13-touch-bar-and-touch-id-256gb/\">MacBook Pro 13 Touch Bar and Touch ID - 256GB</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-body\">\n<p>Full order! Today, a parcel with a laptop hit Sri Lanka! Delivery lasted 8 days. It's fast thanks</p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 08/07/2019</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input name=\"review_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"7190\">\n<input name=\"total_review_comments\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\"/>\n<div class=\"review-header\">\n<span class=\"review-author-name\"><div class=\"customer-badge badge-nobadge\"></div>Knight</span>\n<div class=\"ms-ratings comments\">\n<div class=\"ms-empty-stars\"></div>\n<div class=\"ms-full-stars\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-body\">\n<p>COOOL MacBook !</p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 05/07/2019</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input name=\"review_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"7160\">\n<input name=\"total_review_comments\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\"/>\n<div class=\"review-header\">\n<span class=\"review-author-name\"><div class=\"customer-badge badge-nobadge\"></div>Litarery</span>\n<div clas