uy</p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 30/06/2019</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input name=\"review_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"7132\">\n<input name=\"total_review_comments\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\"/>\n<div class=\"review-header\">\n<span class=\"review-author-name\"><div class=\"customer-badge badge-nobadge\"></div>Fappinho</span>\n<div class=\"ms-ratings comments\">\n<div class=\"ms-empty-stars\"></div>\n<div class=\"ms-full-stars\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Buyed product: <a class=\"product-name\" href=\"http://deepmexzsejpzqid3k7knaas2p73dko6kxgpou7oey7vqtmrhopjyqyd.onion/products/iphone-xs-max-64-gb/\">iPhone XS MAX 64 GB</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-body\">\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 27/06/2019</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input name=\"review_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"7117\">\n<input name=\"total_review_comments\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\"/>\n<div class=\"review-header\">\n<span class=\"review-author-name\"><div class=\"customer-badge badge-nobadge\"></div>Purifly</span>\n<div class=\"ms-ratings comments\">\n<div class=\"ms-empty-stars\"></div>\n<div class=\"ms-full-stars\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Buyed product: <a class=\"product-name\" href=\"http://deepmexzsejpzqid3k7knaas2p73dko6kxgpou7oey7vqtmrhopjyqyd.onion/products/iphone-xs-256-gb-1/\">iPhone XS 256 GB </a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-body\">\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 27/06/2019</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input name=\"review_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"7149\">\n<input name=\"total_review_comments\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\"/>\n<div class=\"review-header\">\n<span class=\"review-author-name\"><div class=\"customer-badge badge-nobadge\"></div>FuryTR</span>\n<div class=\"ms-ratings comments\">\n<div class=\"ms-empty-stars\"></div>\n<div class=\"ms-full-stars\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Buyed product: <a class=\"product-name\" href=\"http://deepmexzsejpzqid3k7knaas2p73dko6kxgpou7oey7vqtmrhopjyqyd.onion/products/iphone-x-64-gb-1/\">iPhone X 64 GB</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-body\">\n<p>Thank you guys for not fooling me like on another site.</p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 26/06/2019</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input name=\"review_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"7184\">\n<input name=\"total_review_comments\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\"/>\n<div class=\"review-header\">\n<span class=\"review-author-name\"><div class=\"customer-badge badge-nobadge\"></div>JizzYQ</span>\n<div class=\"ms-ratings comments\">\n<div class=\"ms-empty-stars\"></div>\n<div class=\"ms-full-stars\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-body\">\n<p>Delivery to France in 4 days. Thanks.\r\nMacBook original, no problem!</p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 24/06/2019</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input name=\"review_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"7140\">\n<input name=\"total_review_comments\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\"/>\n<div class=\"review-header\">\n<span class=\"review-author-name\"><div class=\"customer-badge badge-nobadge\"></div>NotoRiousDa</span>\n<div class=\"ms-ratings comments\">\n<div class=\"ms-empty-stars\"></div>\n<div class=\"ms-full-stars\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Buyed product: <a class=\"product-name\" href=\"http://deepmexzsejpzqid3k7knaas2p73dko6kxgpou7oey7vqtmrhopjyqyd.onion/products/iphone-xs-max-256-gb/\">iPhone XS MAX 256 GB</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-body\">\n<p>Thanks for quick delivery.\r\nGuys who doubt, I confirm - this is the original iPhone!!!!!!!!</p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 22/06/2019</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></di