>\n<p>Buyed product: <a class=\"product-name\" href=\"http://deepmexzsejpzqid3k7knaas2p73dko6kxgpou7oey7vqtmrhopjyqyd.onion/products/iphone-xs-max-512-gb/\">iPhone XS MAX 512 GB</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-body\">\n<p>Ho sempre sognato un telefono costoso e il mio sogno si è avverato! Il telefono è arrivato in 6 giorni. Grazie ragazzi!</p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 10/03/2019</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input name=\"review_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"2423\">\n<input name=\"total_review_comments\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\"/>\n<div class=\"review-header\">\n<span class=\"review-author-name\"><div class=\"customer-badge badge-nobadge\"></div>Ylidis</span>\n<div class=\"ms-ratings comments\">\n<div class=\"ms-empty-stars\"></div>\n<div class=\"ms-full-stars\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Buyed product: <a class=\"product-name\" href=\"http://deepmexzsejpzqid3k7knaas2p73dko6kxgpou7oey7vqtmrhopjyqyd.onion/products/iphone-xs-512-gb-1/\">iPhone XS 512 GB </a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-body\">\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 10/03/2019</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input name=\"review_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"4097\">\n<input name=\"total_review_comments\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\"/>\n<div class=\"review-header\">\n<span class=\"review-author-name\"><div class=\"customer-badge badge-gb\">Gold Buyer</div>Yerdetis</span>\n<div class=\"ms-ratings comments\">\n<div class=\"ms-empty-stars\"></div>\n<div class=\"ms-full-stars\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Buyed product: <a class=\"product-name\" href=\"http://deepmexzsejpzqid3k7knaas2p73dko6kxgpou7oey7vqtmrhopjyqyd.onion/products/macbook-pro-15-512gb/\">MacBook Pro 15 Touch Bar and Touch ID; 512GB</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-body\">\n<p>the courier delivered the goods to the appointed place, received the goods without problems. Thank! The quality of the product is perfect</p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 10/03/2019</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input name=\"review_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"2543\">\n<input name=\"total_review_comments\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\"/>\n<div class=\"review-header\">\n<span class=\"review-author-name\"><div class=\"customer-badge badge-pb\">Platinum Byuer</div>Har</span>\n<div class=\"ms-ratings comments\">\n<div class=\"ms-empty-stars\"></div>\n<div class=\"ms-full-stars\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Buyed product: <a class=\"product-name\" href=\"http://deepmexzsejpzqid3k7knaas2p73dko6kxgpou7oey7vqtmrhopjyqyd.onion/products/iphone-x-64-gb-1/\">iPhone X 64 GB</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-body\">\n<p>Volevo scegliere un regalo per la mia ragazza. La scelta è caduta sullo smartphone. Ma nei normali negozi online costa solo soldi! Qui i ragazzi vendono quasi per l'acquisto, tutto è controllato. Grazie a loro, tutto è venuto in meno di 5 giorni.</p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 09/03/2019</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input name=\"review_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"2452\">\n<input name=\"total_review_comments\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\"/>\n<div class=\"review-header\">\n<span class=\"review-author-name\"><div class=\"customer-badge badge-nobadge\"></div>Xtoliusan</span>\n<div class=\"ms-ratings comments\">\n<div class=\"ms-empty-stars\"></div>\n<div class=\"ms-full-stars\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Buyed product: <a class=\"product-name\" href=\"http://deepmexzsejpzqid3k7knaas2p73dko6kxgpou7oey7vqtmrhopjyqyd.onion/products/iphone-xs-max-64-gb/\">iPhone XS MAX 64 GB</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-body\">\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 09/03/2019</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input name=\"revi