iew-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input name=\"review_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"2557\">\n<input name=\"total_review_comments\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\"/>\n<div class=\"review-header\">\n<span class=\"review-author-name\"><div class=\"customer-badge badge-gb\">Gold Buyer</div>Mane</span>\n<div class=\"ms-ratings comments\">\n<div class=\"ms-empty-stars\"></div>\n<div class=\"ms-full-stars\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Buyed product: <a class=\"product-name\" href=\"http://deepmexzsejpzqid3k7knaas2p73dko6kxgpou7oey7vqtmrhopjyqyd.onion/products/iphone-x-256-gb-1/\">iPhone X 256 GB</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-body\">\n<p>J'ai décidé de lancer une entreprise d'électronique. Et ainsi je me suis familiarisé avec ce service, où ils vendent des iPhones pour presque rien. Les gars, grâce à vous, je viens de me lever dans quelques mois! Merci beaucoup Bonne chance dans le développement.\r\n</p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 19/03/2018</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input name=\"review_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"2528\">\n<input name=\"total_review_comments\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\"/>\n<div class=\"review-header\">\n<span class=\"review-author-name\"><div class=\"customer-badge badge-nobadge\"></div>Uma</span>\n<div class=\"ms-ratings comments\">\n<div class=\"ms-empty-stars\"></div>\n<div class=\"ms-full-stars\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Buyed product: <a class=\"product-name\" href=\"http://deepmexzsejpzqid3k7knaas2p73dko6kxgpou7oey7vqtmrhopjyqyd.onion/products/iphone-x-64-gb-1/\">iPhone X 64 GB</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-body\">\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"review-date\">on 13/03/2018</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review-comments expanded\"></div>\n</input></div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n<input name=\"review_id\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"222\">\n<input name=\"total_review_comments\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\"/>\n<div class