  "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<head>\n<title>DashTor - Cloned Credit Cards and Paypal Services</title>\n<!-- BANNER CODE VERSION 3.0 -->\n<center> <a href=\"\" target=\"_top\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"1\" height=\"182\" src=\"bannerdashtor.png\" width=\"779\"/></a> </center>\n<!-- BANNER CODE VERSION 3.0 -->\n<meta content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Type\"/>\n<link href=\"css/style.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"container\">Dashtor Financial Service is Active 24 hours! EVERYDAY, Accepts ESCROW, EMAIL US:dashtor@protonmail.com\n\t\n  <div id=\"menu\"> <a href=\"cards.html\">CARDS</a>         <a href=\"paypal.html\">PAYPAL</a>         <a href=\"wu.html\">W-UNION</a>         <a href=\"shipping.html\">SHIPPING</a>         <a href=\"pricing.html\">PRICING</a>         <a href=\"http://vrmfaneizwqouf5k.onion/wisdom/\">FEEDBACK</a>         <a href=\"pgp.html\">PGP</a>        <a href=\"escrow.html\">ESCROW</a></div>\n<div id=\"sidebar\"><strong><em><q>We have some fresh Cards and new Paypal accounts today, we hope it will satisfy you again - - - DashCrew</q></em></strong>\n<p><center><img src=\"red.gif\"/></center></p></div></div></body></html>\n<p><center><a href=\"http://vrmfaneizwqouf5k.onion/wisdom/thread.php?file=these-are-the-most-frequent-questions-asked-by-our-new-customers#nnf_new-form\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"faq.png\"/></a></center></p>\n<h1></h1>\n\n<div id=\"main\">\n<img alt=\"Home\" src=\"credit.png\" style=\"border: none;\"/>\n<p>These are cloned credit cards, Every card comes with a 4 digit pin &amp; it is safe to use everywhere in the world that accepts master card &amp; visa. I have enough supplies to make 100+ Master/Visa Credit/Debit cards per day. The card won't ever get frozen and can be used just like a regular credit card, These cards can be used to shop in stores and you can use them to cashout in ATMs worldwide.</p>\n<div id=\"meru\"><font color=\"#FFFFFF\" face=\"Georgia\"> EMBOSSING ANYTHING ON CARDS </font></div></div>\n<p>If you want i can emboss your prefered bank logo and name on the card</p>\n<div id=\"meru\"><font color=\"#FFFFFF\" face=\"Georgia\"> WHERE CAN THE CARDS BE USED?  </font></div>\n<p>✔ ATM</p>\n<p>✔ Stores</p>\n<p>✔ Online</p>\n<p>Once you purchase, we will email you a Full Guide on how to safely cash out. </p>\n<div id=\"meru\"><font color=\"#FFFFFF\" face=\"Georgia\"> PRICE </font></div>\n<p>Price is $300 per card, Guaranteed to have at least $5000 left on CC limit, most are over $5500</p>\n<div id=\"meru\"><font color=\"#FFFFFF\" face=\"Georgia\"> BY PURCHASING YOU AGREE TO THE FOLLOWING </font></div>\n<p>✔ If you try to lie and request a replacement to receive an extra card, you will be blacklisted from future sales.</p>\n<p>✔ I reserve the right occasionally to select my customers.</p>\n<div id=\"meru\"><font color=\"#FFFFFF\" face=\"Georgia\"> REFUND </font></div>\n<p>Our success rate is 99%, but we will refund you in full or ship another card/s in case of failure.</p>\n<div id=\"meru\"><font color=\"#FFFFFF\" face=\"Georgia\"> ABOUT ME </font></div>\n<p>I was active on the old Nucleus and Evolution marketplace Untill it was taken down by the authorities. We had about 4000+ sales and we were still active as top sellers on other market</p>\n<h2>Contact - dashtor@protonmail.com</h2>\n<p><center><a href=\"http://vrmfaneizwqouf5k.onion/wisdom/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"bluearrow.gif\"/></a></center></p>\n<center><a href=\"http://vrmfaneizwqouf5k.onion/wisdom/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"helpdesk.png\"/></a></center>\n\n<div id=\"footer\"> Â© 2011 - 2020 Dashtor Financial Services. All rights reserved.  <span class=\"separator\">|</span></div> \n\n<div align=\"center\">Contact - dashtor@protonmail.com</div>\n\n",
