div class=\"visible-title1 clearfix\">\n<span class=\"pull-left\">\n<a data-rel=\"prettyPhoto\" href=\"upload/big-pics/kingdom-cckingdomtmf7w7l-photo-14-big.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-height: auto;\"><i class=\"fa fa-search\"></i></a>\n</span>\n<span class=\"pull-right\">\n</span>\n</div><!-- end visible-title -->\n</div><!-- end magnifier -->\n</div><!-- end portfolio -->\n</li>\n<li class=\"portfolio-item mix cat1 cat2 cat3\">\n<div class=\"portfolio-style-1 entry wow fadeIn\" data-wow-delay=\"0.2s\" data-wow-duration=\"1s\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"upload/kingdom-cckingdomtmf7w7l-photo-18.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-height: auto;\"/>\n<div class=\"magnifier\">\n<div class=\"visible-title\">\n</div><!-- end visible-title -->\n<div class=\"visible-title1 clearfix\">\n<span class=\"pull-left\">\n<a data-rel=\"prettyPhoto\" href=\"upload/big-pics/kingdom-cckingdomtmf7w7l-photo-18-big.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-height: auto;\"><i class=\"fa fa-search\"></i></a>\n</span>\n<span class=\"pull-right\">\n</span>\n</div><!-- end visible-title -->\n</div><!-- end magnifier -->\n</div><!-- end portfolio -->\n</li>\n</ul><!-- end row -->\n</div>\n<div class=\"button-wrapper text-center\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary border-radius btn-lg btn-dark\" href=\"photos.html\">MORE PHOTOS</a>\n</div><!-- end button wrapper -->\n</section><!-- end container -->\n<!-- end section -->\n<section class=\"section white\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"section-title text-center\">\n<h4>About Us</h4>\n<hr/>\n<h3>Little info about how we operate</h3>\n</div><!-- end title -->\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\n<h3><center>CC KINGDOM Is an international team that deal with ATMs skimming and malware attacks for cloning credit cards and taking cvv database, hacking and phishing websites and alot of more. we have kingdom team in usa, canada, east &amp; west europe, russia, australia and hong kong so we have the ability to do very safe shipments to any country! PLEASE READ ALL INFO ON OUR SITE BEFORE CONTACTING US BECAUSE WE DO NOT RESPOND TO EMAILS WITH QUESTIONS THAT HAVE ALREADY ANSWERED ON OUR SITE ON THE HOME / FAQ PAGE. WE PROVIDE ORIGINAL photos OF OUR CREDIT CARDS TO GIVE THE FULL CONFIDENCE TO OUR NEW CUSTOMERS TO MAKE THEIR FIRST order. THIS IS OUR ONLY SITE – <a href=\"HTTP://CCKINGDOMTMF7W7L.ONION\"><font color=\"#e5e4e2\">HTTP://CCKINGDOMTMF7W7L.ONION</font></a> THAT PROTECTED WITH WATERMARKS on THE photos. WE DO NOT HAVE OTHER SITES SO ALWAYS CHECK THE DOMAIN OF OUR SITE TO PROTECT YOURSELF FROM SCAMMERS! DON’T ASK FOR FREE CARD OR PAYPAL OR JOIN TO OUR TEAM BECAUSE WE DO NOT PROVIDE FREE SERVICES AND WE DO NOT RECRUITERS ANYONE THROUGH THE DARKNET BECAUSE THAT TOO DANGEROUS!</center></h3>\n</div><!-- end col -->\n</div><!-- end row -->\n</div><!-- end container -->\n</section><!-- end section -->\n<section class=\"section fullscreen paralbackground parallax\" data-diff=\"100\" data-img-height=\"525\" data-img-width=\"1600\" style=\"background-image:url('images/cc-kingdom-credit-cards-video-background.jpg');\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"section-title text-center\">\n<h4>Faqs</h4>\n<hr/>\n<h3>Frequently asked questions</h3>\n</div><!-- end title -->\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-8 col-md-offset-2\">\n<div class=\"accordion-widget\">\n<div class=\"accordion-toggle-2\">\n<div class=\"panel-group\" id=\"accordion\">\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\n<div class=\"panel-title\">\n<a class=\"accordion-toggle\" data-parent=\"#accordion1\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" href=\"#collapseOne\">\n<h3>Who Are You? <i class=\"indicator fa fa-minus\"></i></h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel-collapse collapse in\" id=\"collapseOne\">\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\n<p>CC KINGDOM Is an international team that deal with ATMs skimming and malware attacks for cloning credit cards and taking cvv database, hacking and phishing websites and alot of more. We have over 10 years of experience and we provide a very quality and professional service to our old customers. For our new customers we are exclusively uploaded original photos of the credit cards we sell in order to provide you with the confidence to do your first order</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\n<div class=\"panel-title\">\n<a class=\"accordion-toggle\" data-parent=\"#accordion1\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" href=\"#collapseTwo\">\n<h3>What are the payment options? <i class=\"indicator fa fa-plus\"></i></h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel-collapse collapse\" id=\"collapseTwo\">\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\n<p>We accept Bitcoin payments only. Do not know what is Bitcoin and how to use it? Visit<a href=\"https://bitcoin.org/\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><font color=\"#FFD700\"> Bitcoin.org</font></strong></a> and you can get all the info on how to use Bitcoin.</p>\n<p><strong><font color=\"#e7e7e7\"><u>Top sites to buy Bitcoin (ClearNet Links):</u></font></strong><a href=\"https://www.coinbase.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><font color=\"#FFD700\"> Coinbase</font></strong></a> , <a href=\"https://localbitcoins.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><font color=\"#FFD700\">LocalBitcoins</font></strong></a>, <a href=\"https://www.coinmama.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#FFD700\">CoinMama</font></a>, <a href=\"https://wallofcoins.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#FFD700\">WallOfCoins</font></a>, <a href=\"https://spectrocoin.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#FFD700\">SpectroCoin</font></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\n<div class=\"panel-title\">\n<a class=\"accordion-toggle\" data-parent=\"#accordion1\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" href=\"#collapseThree\">\n<h3>Why do you sell these cards and not withdraw the money yourself? <i class=\"indicator fa fa-plus\"></i></h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel-collapse collapse\" id=\"collapseThree\">\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\n<p>Good question!. you have to understand that if we start to make large withdrawals of money we will be caught because the legal authorities will immediately check who are responsible for withdrawing unusual amounts of money from same area in short time, so we must keep extra safety! The first rule to succeed in the carding and hacking field is to keep a low profile! Yes, some of us have families and therefore we cannot move from one apartment to another as often as required in such a situation and therefore the sale of our services in dark web is a win-win situation, thanks to Bitcoin we earn absolute privacy and you earn the opportunity to change your financial situation. Most importantly, on our site you can find real photos of the credit cards we sell.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\n<div class=\"panel-title\">\n<a class=\"accordion-toggle\" data-parent=\"#accordion1\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" href=\"#collapseFour\">\n<h3>Are escrow accepted? <i class=\"indicator fa fa-plus\"></i></h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel-collapse collapse\" id=\"collapseFour\">\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\n<p>Yes, We accept escrow payments.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\n<div class=\"panel-title\">\n<a class=\"accordion-toggle\" data-parent=\"#accordion1\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" href=\"#collapseFive\">\n<h3>Which countries can I order your cards? <i class=\"indicator fa fa-plus\"></i></h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel-collapse collapse\" id=\"collapseFive\">\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\n<p>We ship worldwide.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\n<div class=\"panel-title\">\n<a class=\"accordion-toggle\" data-parent=\"#accordion1\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" href=\"#collapseServicesCosts\">\n<h3>What are the costs of credit cards and PayPal accounts? <i class=\"indicator fa fa-plus\"></i></h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel-collapse collapse\" id=\"collapseServicesCosts\">\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\n<p><strong><font color=\"#FFD700\"><u>PREPAID CREDIT CARDS (USD / EUR):</u></font></strong></p>\n<br/>\n<p>2,500 USD($) / EUR(€) CREDIT CARD - COST: <font color=\"#FFD700\"><u>150 ($) / (€)</u></font></p>\n<br/>\n<p>5,000 USD($) / EUR(€) CREDIT CARD - COST: <font color=\"#FFD700\"><u>260 ($) / (€)</u></font></p>\n<br/>\n<p>7,500 USD($) / EUR(€) CREDIT CARD - COST: <font color=\"#FFD700\"><u>350 ($) / (€)</u></font></p>\n<br/><br/>\n<p><strong><font color=\"#FFD700\"><u>PAYPAL ACCOUNTS (USD / EUR):</u></font></strong></p>\n<br/>\n<p>2,500 USD($) / EUR(€) ACCOUNT - COST: <font color=\"#FFD700\"><u>140 ($) / (€)</u></font></p>\n<br/>\n<p>5,000 USD($) / EUR(€) ACCOUNT - COST: <font color=\"#FFD700\"><u>250 ($) / (€)</u></font></p>\n<br/>\n<p>7,500 USD($) / EUR(€) ACCOUNT - COST: <font color=\"#FFD700\"><u>340 ($) / (€)</u></font></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\n<div class=\"panel-title\">\n<a class=\"accordion-toggle\" data-parent=\"#accordion1\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" href=\"#collapseSix\">\n<h3>What are the costs and times of credit cards deliveries? <i class=\"indicator fa fa-plus\"></i></h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel-collapse collapse\" id=\"collapseSix\">\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\n<p><strong><font color=\"#FFD700\"><u>YOU CAN CHOOSE BETWEEN 3 SHIPPING METHODS:</u></font></strong></p>\n<br>\n<p>1) <strong>Free Shipping <font color=\"#FFD700\">(Without Tracking Number)</font> -</strong> Takes between 5-14 days depending on the country you live in | <strong>Cost: <font color=\"#FFD700\">Free</font></strong></p>\n<br>\n<p>2) <strong>Express Shipping <font color=\"#FFD700\">(With Tracking Number)</font> -</strong> Takes between 3-7 days depending on the country you live in | <strong>Cost: <font color=\"#FFD700\">20$</font></strong></p>\n<br>\n<p>3) <strong>OverNight Shipping <font color=\"#FFD700\">(With Tracking Number)</font> -</strong> This shipping type can be selected only if you live in the following Countries / Continents: USA, Canada, West and Eastern Europe, Russia, Australia and Hong Kong. Shipment takes 1-3 days | <strong>Cost: <font color=\"#FFD700\">30$</font></strong></p>\n</br></br></br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\n<div class=\"panel-title\">\n<a class=\"accordion-toggle\" data-parent=\"#accordion1\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" href=\"#collapseSeven\">\n<h3>Can I order a credit card or PayPal account with a different amount of money? <i class=\"indicator fa fa-plus\"></i></h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel-collapse collapse\" id=\"collapseSeven\">\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\n<p>No, the amounts that can be ordered in the credit cards or in the paypal accounts appear on the site and there is no possibility of making custom orders.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\n<div class=\"panel-title\">\n<a class=\"accordion-toggle\" data-parent=\"#accordion1\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" href=\"#collapseEight\">\n<h3>Is it safe to use PayPal accounts? <i class=\"indicator fa fa-plus\"></i></h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel-collapse collapse\" id=\"collapseEight\">\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\n<p>Yes, because these are not hacked accounts! these accounts are verified by all required identification information with transaction history without problems as the amount of money you ordered will be deposited into this account by our team. You will receive from us a socks5 proxy and a guide on how to convert the money to BTC / CC / BANK along with account access information. There is an option that our team will perform the conversion to bitcoin for an additional 70$ fee</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\n<div class=\"panel-title\">\n<a class=\"accordion-toggle\" data-parent=\"#accordion1\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" href=\"#collapseNine\">\n<h3>Is it safe to order your cards? <i class=\"indicator fa fa-plus\"></i></h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel-collapse collapse\" id=\"collapseNine\">\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\n<p>Yes, absolutely safe! First of all, there is no law prohibiting credit cards by mail. Today, there are many companies that send their credit cards by mail to any place in the world. For example - Payoneer. In addition, we send the cards in a quality envelope that gives the feeling of an official company and eliminates any suspicion that you made an order through the dark web.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n<div class=\"panel-heading\">\n<div class=\"panel-title\">\n<a class=\"accordion-toggle\" data-parent=\"#accordion1\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" href=\"#collapseTen\">\n<h3>how can i contact you? <i class=\"indicator fa fa-plus\"></i></h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel-collapse collapse\" id=\"collapseTen\">\n<div class=\"panel-body\">\n<p>Go to <a href=\"contact-about.html\">Contact Us </a>Page</p><br/>\n<p>Send Massage to: <font color=\"#FFD700\">CCKINGDOM@TUTA.IO</font></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><!-- accordion -->\n</div><!-- end accordion-widget -->\n</div><!-- end col -->\n</div><!-- end row -->\n<div class=\"button-wrapper text-center\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary border-radius btn-lg btn-dark\" href=\"faqs.html\">READ MORE</a>\n</div><!-- end button wrapper -->\n</div><!-- end container -->\n</section><!-- end section -->\n<section class=\"copyrights\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\n<center><p>© COPYRIGHT CC KINGDOM 2012-2019 - CCKINGDOM@TUTA.IO</p></center>\n</div>\n</div><!-- end row -->\n</div><!-- end container -->\n</section><!-- end copyrights -->\n<div class=\"backtotop\">Scroll to Top</div>\n<!-- end wrapper -->\n<script src=\"js/jquery.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"js/bootstrap.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"js/retina.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"js/jquery.prettyPhoto.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"js/wow.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"js/parallax.min.js\"></script>\n<!-- PORTFOLIO -->\n<script src=\"js/isotope.pkgd.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"js/imagesloaded.pkgd.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"js/masonry.pkgd.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"js/portfolio.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"js/main.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"js/carousel.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"js/owl-main.js\"></script>\n\n",
  "CC KINGDOM - CREDIT CARDS & PAYPAL ACCOUNTS",
