id=\"content\">\n<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"disable-title site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<article class=\"post-109 page type-page status-publish hentry\" id=\"post-109\">\n<header class=\"entry-header\">\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\">Team Declaration</h1> </header><!-- .entry-header -->\n<div class=\"entry-content\">\n<p><strong>Team Premium</strong> is the alliance of sellers providing top quality products around the world. It is a group of professionals who decided to combine their efforts and experience to provide fast and qualified support and delivery.</p>\n<p><center></center></p>\n<h3>Our mission is to fight numerous and dishonorable scams flooded DeepWeb.</h3>\n<p></p></div></article></main></div></div>\n<h4>Team Premium declare the highest value clients’ satisfaction:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Team member is obliged to do his best to make their client happy.</li>\n<li>Team member will never sell anything that may cause any damage, including reputation, to his client.</li>\n<li>In case team member sells anything that requires specific knowledge, it is his responsibility to give that knowledge to his clients.</li>\n<li>Team member is obliged to provide only top quality products in a specific sphere.</li>\n<li>Team member is not allowed to overprice his products.</li>\n<li>Team member is obliged to replace a product in case of it’s malfunction or make a 100% refund by client’s request.</li>\n<li>Failure to follow any of clauses above leads to disqualification.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Team Premium was founded on January 5, 2019. Members first met on <a href=\"http://z57whuq7jaqgmh6d.onion/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Undermarket</a> marketplace and since then decided to stick together.</p>\n<p>Team Premium line-up:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"/vendor/premium-ccs/\" target=\"_blank\">Premium CCS</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/vendor/premium-iphones/\" target=\"_blank\">Premium iPhones</a> (ex. Zenda iPhones)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/vendor/gifter/\" target=\"_blank\">Gifter</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>Feel free to choose your favorite vendor from the menu.</p>\n<!-- .entry-content -->\n<!-- #post-109 -->\n<!-- #main -->\n<!-- #primary -->\n<!-- #content -->\n<footer class=\"site-footer\" id=\"colophon\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/WPFooter\">\n<div class=\"footer-center\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"site-info\">\n<p>\n\t\t\t\tAll rights reserved  © Team Premium. Since 2019\n\t\t\t</p>\n<div class=\"embed_os\"><a href=\"http://4r4zaei5qa7qq5ha.onion#6thhimkhby4az3vz.onion\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://4r4zaei5qa7qq5ha.onion/ratings/6thhimkhby4az3vz.onion.png\"/></a>\n</div>\n</div><!-- .site-info -->\n</footer><!-- #colophon -->\n<a href=\"#\" id=\"totop\"><span class=\"dashicons dashicons-arrow-up-alt2\"></span></a>\n<script id=\"tmpl-wp-playlist-current-item\" type=\"text/html\">\n\t<# if ( data.image ) { #>\n\t<img src=\"{{ data.thumb.src }}\" alt=\"\" />\n\t<# } #>\n\t<div class=\"wp-playlist-caption\">\n\t\t<span class=\"wp-playlist-item-meta wp-playlist-item-title\">&#8220;{{ data.title }}&#8221;</span>\n\t\t<# if ( data.meta.album ) { #><span class=\"wp-playlist-item-meta wp-playlist-item-album\">{{ data.meta.album }}</span><# } #>\n\t\t<# if ( data.meta.artist ) { #><span class=\"wp-playlist-item-meta wp-playlist-item-artist\">{{ data.meta.artist }}</span><# } #>\n\t</div>\n</script>\n<script id=\"tmpl-wp-playlist-item\" type=\"text/html\">\n\t<div class=\"wp-playlist-item\">\n\t\t<a class=\"wp-playlist-caption\" href=\"{{ data.src }}\">\n\t\t\t{{ data.index ? ( data.index + '. ' ) : '' }}\n\t\t\t<# if ( data.caption ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t{{ data.caption }}\n\t\t\t<# } else { #>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"wp-playlist-item-title\">&#8220;{{{ data.title }}}&#8221;</span>\n\t\t\t\t<# if ( data.artists && data.meta.artist ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"wp-playlist-item-artist\"> &mdash; {{ data.meta.artist }}</span>\n\t\t\t\t<# } #>\n\t\t\t<# } #>\n\t\t</a>\n\t\t<# if ( data.meta.length_formatted ) {