n<div class=\"clearfix colelem\" id=\"pu1385\"><!-- group -->\n<div class=\"clip_frame grpelem\" id=\"u1385\"><!-- image -->\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"block\" height=\"44\" id=\"u1385_img\" src=\"images/earth.png?crc=132303236\" width=\"43\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clip_frame grpelem\" id=\"u1389\"><!-- image -->\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"block\" height=\"43\" id=\"u1389_img\" src=\"images/safe.png?crc=14897079\" width=\"33\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clip_frame grpelem\" id=\"u1418\"><!-- image -->\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"block\" height=\"44\" id=\"u1418_img\" src=\"images/clock.png?crc=4255679198\" width=\"44\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clearfix colelem\" id=\"pu1379-4\"><!-- group -->\n<div class=\"clearfix grpelem\" id=\"u1379-4\"><!-- content -->\n<p>Worldwide money transfers!</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clearfix grpelem\" id=\"u1383-4\"><!-- content -->\n<p>It’s safe!</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clearfix grpelem\" id=\"u1384-4\"><!-- content -->\n<p>This is fast!</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clearfix colelem\" id=\"pu1380-4\"><!-- group -->\n<div class=\"clearfix grpelem\" id=\"u1380-4\"><!-- content -->\n<p>Wester Union is an international transfer. You can pick up your money transfer at any Western Union office</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clearfix grpelem\" id=\"u1381-4\"><!-- content -->\n<p>Money transfers are completely safe. It’s like if you get paid for remote work on the Internet.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clearfix grpelem\" id=\"u1382-8\"><!-- content -->\n<p>We will send your transfer within a few</p>\n<p>hours after payment and send</p>\n<p>you MTCN!</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clearfix colelem\" id=\"pu1343\"><!-- group -->\n<div class=\"shadow rounded-corners clearfix grpelem\" id=\"u1343\"><!-- column -->\n<div class=\"clip_frame clearfix colelem\" id=\"u1336\"><!-- image -->\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"position_content\" height=\"93\" id=\"u1336_img\" src=\"images/western%20union.png?crc=3914662870\" width=\"147\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clearfix colelem\" id=\"u1321-4\"><!-- content -->\n<p>Western Union $1000</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clearfix colelem\" id=\"u1324-4\"><!-- content -->\n<p>$95</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"shadow rounded-corners clearfix grpelem\" id=\"u1309\"><!-- column -->\n<div class=\"clip_frame clearfix colelem\" id=\"u1365\"><!-- image -->\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"position_content\" height=\"93\" id=\"u1365_img\" src=\"images/western%20union.png?crc=3914662870\" width=\"147\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clearfix colelem\" id=\"u1352-4\"><!-- content -->\n<p>Western Union $2000</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clearfix colelem\" id=\"u1333-4\"><!-- content -->\n<p>$169</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"shadow rounded-corners clearfix grpelem\" id=\"u1315\"><!-- column -->\n<div class=\"clip_frame clearfix colelem\" id=\"u1372\"><!-- image -->\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"position_content\" height=\"93\" id=\"u1372_img\" src=\"images/western%20union.png?crc=3914662870\" width=\"147\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clearfix colelem\" id=\"u1330-4\"><!-- content -->\n<p>Western Union $3000</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clearfix colelem\" id=\"u1327-4\"><!-- content -->\n<p>$249</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clearfix colelem\" id=\"u3724-4\"><!-- content -->\n<p>contact us for purchase - millionaire.private.club@protonmail.com</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"colelem\" id=\"u3108\"><!-- simple frame --></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"browser_width colelem\" id=\"u1428-bw\">\n<div id=\"u1428\"><!-- column -->\n<div class=\"clearfix\" id=\"u1428_align_to_page\">\n<div class=\"colelem\" id=\"u3107\"><!-- simple frame --></div>\n<div class=\"clearfix colelem\" id=\"u1431-4\"><!-- content -->\n<p>PayPal Transfers</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clearfix colelem\" id=\"u1434-4\"><!-- content -->\n<p>We are using Hacked Verified Paypal Accounts to transfer funds using our own personal method to make sure you don’t get any dispute. Once Funds has been sent, it is 100% clean and you get zero problems!</p>\n</div