ain_menu\">\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"400\">\nwelcome to TorBox.<br/>\nThis is a hidden mailbox service only accessible from TOR.\nThere is no connection between TorBox and the public internet: All the messages are sent and received within TorBox.\n<br/><br/>\nJust <a href=\"http://torbox3uiot6wchz.onion/signup-en.php\">sign up</a> for a new TorBox and start sending and receiving email within TOR.\n<br/><br/>\nContact us at postmaster @ torbox3uiot6wchz.onion<br/>\nYou can use our <a href=\"http://torbox3uiot6wchz.onion/torbox_pgp_pubkey.txt\" target=\"_blank\">PGP key</a>.\n  </td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<!-- FOOTER -->\n<div id=\"footer\">\n<a href=\"http://torbox3uiot6wchz.onion/\" target=\"_blank\">TorBox</a>\n   |   \nUnbeatable Mailbox service in TOR\n   |   \n<a href=\"http://torbox3uiot6wchz.onion/\" target=\"_blank\">torbox3uiot6wchz.onion</a>\n   |   \n<a href=\"http://torbox3uiot6wchz.onion/torbox_pgp_pubkey.txt\" target=\"_blank\">PGP Pubkey</a>\n</div>\n<!-- FOOTER -->\n</body>\n</html>\n",
