  "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html><head>\n<title>Daniel - E-Mail and XMPP</title>\n<meta content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Type\"/>\n<meta content=\"Daniel Winzen\" name=\"author\"/>\n<meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" name=\"viewport\"/>\n</head><body>\n<div id=\"banner\"><h1>E-Mail and XMPP</h1></div>\n<style type=\"text/css\">body{margin:0;font-size:16px}#banner{background:#0000FF;text-align:center}#banner h1{font-size: 24px;color:#FFFFFF;margin:0;padding:17px}#content{margin-left:170px;margin-bottom:30px;padding:5px 5px;word-wrap:break-word;min-height:100vh}#nav{position:absolute;margin-top:0px;padding:0;border:1px solid silver;background-color:#FFFFFF;text-align:left;width:160px}#nav li{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:10px}#nav a{display:block;font-weight:bold}#nav a:link{color:#000000;background-color:#EEEEEE}#nav a:visited{color:#666666;background-color:#EEEEEE}#nav a:hover{color:#000000;background-color:#FFFFFF}#nav a:active{color:#FFFFFF;background-color:#808080}#burger_check{display:none}.table{display:table;width:100%}.row{display:table-row}.cell{border: 1px solid #999999;display:table-cell;padding:3px 3px}.headerrow{display:table-header-group;font-weight:bold}@media (max-width: 768px){body{font-size:18px}#nav{display:none}.burger_nav .bar1,.burger_nav .bar2,.burger_nav .bar3{width: 35px;height: 5px;background-color: #333;margin: 6px 6px}#nav .burger_nav .bar1{transform: rotate(-45deg) translate(-9px, 6px)}#nav .burger_nav .bar2{opacity:0;}#nav .burger_nav .bar3 {transform: rotate(45deg) translate(-8px, -8px)}#content{margin-left:50px;margin-top:-30px}#burger_check:checked+#nav{display:block;left:0;top:0;width:100%;z-index:1}}</style><label class=\"burger_nav\" for=\"burger_check\"><div class=\"bar1\"></div><div class=\"bar2\"></div><div class=\"bar3\"></div></label><input id=\"burger_check\" type=\"checkbox\"/><ul id=\"nav\"><label class=\"burger_nav\" for=\"burger_check\"><div class=\"bar1\"></div><div class=\"bar2\"></div><div class=\"bar3\"></div></label><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/\">Home</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danschat356lctri3zavzh6fbxg2a7lo6z3etgkctzzpspewu7zdsaqd.onion\">Chat</a></li><li><a href=\"http://donionsixbjtiohce24abfgsffo2l4tk26qx464zylumgejukfq2vead.onion/test.php\">Online-Test</a></li><li><a href=\"http://donionsixbjtiohce24abfgsffo2l4tk26qx464zylumgejukfq2vead.onion/onions.php\">Onion link list</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/mail/index.php\">E-Mail + XMPP</a></li><li><a href=\"http://dhosting4xxoydyaivckq7tsmtgi4wfs3flpeyitekkmqwu4v4r46syd.onion\">Hosting</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/tutorials/index.php\">Tutorials</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/faq.php\">FAQ</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/about.php\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/privacy.php\">Privacy policy</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/contact.php\">Contact</a></li></ul><div id=\"content\"><p>Info | <a href=\"/mail/postfixadmin/register.php\" target=\"_blank\">Register</a> | <a href=\"/mail/squirrelmail/src/login.php\" target=\"_blank\">Webmail-Login</a> <small>(Requires Cookies)</small> | <a href=\"/mail/postfixadmin/users/login.php\" target=\"_blank\">Change password and forwarding</a></p>\n<h2>What you will get</h2>\n<p>You get a free anonymous E-Mail address and an XMPP/Jabber account using the same details. Your Jabber ID is user@danwin1210.me and can be connected to directly from clearnet or via TOR hidden service (danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion).</p>\n<p>You will have 25MB of disk space available for your mails. If you desperately need more space, just <a href=\"/contact.php\">contact me</a>. Your E-Mail address will be user@danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion and user@danwin1210.me</p>\n<p>For privacy, please use PGP mail encryption, if you can. This prevents others from reading your mails (including me and/or LEA). GnuPGs official home: <a href=\"https://gnupg.org\">https://gnupg.org</a> Windows GUI: <a href=\"https://gpg4usb.org\">https://gpg4usb.org</a></p>\n<h2>E-Mail Setup</h2>\n<h3>Torified</h3>\nSMTP: danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion Port 25<br/>\nIMAP: danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion Port 143<br/>\nPOP3: danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion Port 110<br/>\nSSL/TLS/StartTLS: No<br/>\nAuthentication: PLAIN, LOGIN<br/>\n<h3>Via clearnet proxy</h3>\nSMTP: danwin1210.me Port 465 (SSL/TLS) or 587 (StartTLS)<br/>\nIMAP: danwin1210.me Port 993 (SSL/TLS) or 143 (StartTLS)<br/>\nPOP3: danwin1210.me Port 995 (SSL/TLS) or 110 (StartTLS)<br/>\nAuthentication: PLAIN, LOGIN<br/>\n<h2>XMPP setup</h2>\nDomain: danwin1210.me<br/>\nConnect server: danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion (optional for torification)<br/>\nFile transfer proxy: proxy.danwin1210.me<br/>\nBOSH URL: https://danwin1210.me:5281/http-bind (only enable if you have to, as it is slower than directly using xmpp)</div></body></html>\n\n\n",
  "Daniel - E-Mail and XMPP",
