  "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html><head>\n<title>Daniel - Home</title>\n<meta content=\"t5MJj8AnNkce5cUQ5ofhghc9baGsxdMuTL1WqiSGsso\" name=\"google-site-verification\"/>\n<meta content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Type\"/>\n<meta content=\"Daniel Winzen\" name=\"author\"/>\n<meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" name=\"viewport\"/>\n</head><body>\n<div id=\"banner\"><h1>Home</h1></div>\n<style type=\"text/css\">body{margin:0;font-size:16px}#banner{background:#0000FF;text-align:center}#banner h1{font-size: 24px;color:#FFFFFF;margin:0;padding:17px}#content{margin-left:170px;margin-bottom:30px;padding:5px 5px;word-wrap:break-word;min-height:100vh}#nav{position:absolute;margin-top:0px;padding:0;border:1px solid silver;background-color:#FFFFFF;text-align:left;width:160px}#nav li{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:10px}#nav a{display:block;font-weight:bold}#nav a:link{color:#000000;background-color:#EEEEEE}#nav a:visited{color:#666666;background-color:#EEEEEE}#nav a:hover{color:#000000;background-color:#FFFFFF}#nav a:active{color:#FFFFFF;background-color:#808080}#burger_check{display:none}.table{display:table;width:100%}.row{display:table-row}.cell{border: 1px solid #999999;display:table-cell;padding:3px 3px}.headerrow{display:table-header-group;font-weight:bold}@media (max-width: 768px){body{font-size:18px}#nav{display:none}.burger_nav .bar1,.burger_nav .bar2,.burger_nav .bar3{width: 35px;height: 5px;background-color: #333;margin: 6px 6px}#nav .burger_nav .bar1{transform: rotate(-45deg) translate(-9px, 6px)}#nav .burger_nav .bar2{opacity:0;}#nav .burger_nav .bar3 {transform: rotate(45deg) translate(-8px, -8px)}#content{margin-left:50px;margin-top:-30px}#burger_check:checked+#nav{display:block;left:0;top:0;width:100%;z-index:1}}</style><label class=\"burger_nav\" for=\"burger_check\"><div class=\"bar1\"></div><div class=\"bar2\"></div><div class=\"bar3\"></div></label><input id=\"burger_check\" type=\"checkbox\"/><ul id=\"nav\"><label class=\"burger_nav\" for=\"burger_check\"><div class=\"bar1\"></div><div class=\"bar2\"></div><div class=\"bar3\"></div></label><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/\">Home</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danschat356lctri3zavzh6fbxg2a7lo6z3etgkctzzpspewu7zdsaqd.onion\">Chat</a></li><li><a href=\"http://donionsixbjtiohce24abfgsffo2l4tk26qx464zylumgejukfq2vead.onion/test.php\">Online-Test</a></li><li><a href=\"http://donionsixbjtiohce24abfgsffo2l4tk26qx464zylumgejukfq2vead.onion/onions.php\">Onion link list</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/mail/index.php\">E-Mail + XMPP</a></li><li><a href=\"http://dhosting4xxoydyaivckq7tsmtgi4wfs3flpeyitekkmqwu4v4r46syd.onion\">Hosting</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/tutorials/index.php\">Tutorials</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/faq.php\">FAQ</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/about.php\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/privacy.php\">Privacy policy</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/contact.php\">Contact</a></li></ul><div id=\"content\"><p>Hello, my name is Daniel and this is my personal onion site, that I develop in my free time. This site is available as <a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion\">TOR hidden service</a> or via my clearnet proxy <a href=\"https://danwin1210.me\" target=\"_blank\">danwin1210.me</a>.</p>\n<p>This is just the landing page, you can navigate to the pages that interest you most by clicking on the entries in the navigation bar on the left.</p>\n<p>You can download my PHP Chat based on LE-CHAT on <a href=\"https://github.com/DanWin/le-chat-php\">GitHub</a>. The onion link list script is now also available for download on <a href=\"https://github.com/DanWin/onion-link-list\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a>. The setup I use for hosting is now also available on <a href=\"https://github.com/DanWin/hosting\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a></p>\n<p>If you like, what I built here, you can support me by donating via <a href=\"https://www.paypal.me/DanWin1210\" target=\"_blank\">PayPal: daniel@danwin1210.me</a>, Monero: 432Z3PTrRso52GHHpmPRpvLhecsnc7EFsVd2TzsCJaNmK4vivDxghRB5yVCj2nzCEGajeF3rBqJ43PcpxRnvZkMs49fufzD , Ethereum: 0xFbd055EEeA3b5a3459FeC6A8FAe631305b1079A0 , Dash: <a href=\"dash:XuZGhWsmf61UXTwBB4QBKx7BhirPjiw7yX\">XuZGhWsmf61UXTwBB4QBKx7BhirPjiw7yX</a> , USD Pax 0xFbd055EEeA3b5a3459FeC6A8FAe631305b1079A0 , Stellar GB5AXS4QWXM3ZVZCHVHC5QJTUGXOUKIVX4WR5AXD23EAI43NWZ6XTUAW or Bitcoin: <a href=\"bitcoin:1K918TvvE4PMPzPuZT7zSDAQV4ZNUjHBm5\">1K918TvvE4PMPzPuZT7zSDAQV4ZNUjHBm5</a></p>\n</div>\n</body></html>\n",
  "Daniel - Home",
