  "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html><head>\n<title>Daniel - Contact</title>\n<meta content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Type\"/>\n<meta content=\"Daniel Winzen\" name=\"author\"/>\n<meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" name=\"viewport\"/>\n</head><body>\n<div id=\"banner\"><h1>Contact</h1></div>\n<style type=\"text/css\">body{margin:0;font-size:16px}#banner{background:#0000FF;text-align:center}#banner h1{font-size: 24px;color:#FFFFFF;margin:0;padding:17px}#content{margin-left:170px;margin-bottom:30px;padding:5px 5px;word-wrap:break-word;min-height:100vh}#nav{position:absolute;margin-top:0px;padding:0;border:1px solid silver;background-color:#FFFFFF;text-align:left;width:160px}#nav li{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:10px}#nav a{display:block;font-weight:bold}#nav a:link{color:#000000;background-color:#EEEEEE}#nav a:visited{color:#666666;background-color:#EEEEEE}#nav a:hover{color:#000000;background-color:#FFFFFF}#nav a:active{color:#FFFFFF;background-color:#808080}#burger_check{display:none}.table{display:table;width:100%}.row{display:table-row}.cell{border: 1px solid #999999;display:table-cell;padding:3px 3px}.headerrow{display:table-header-group;font-weight:bold}@media (max-width: 768px){body{font-size:18px}#nav{display:none}.burger_nav .bar1,.burger_nav .bar2,.burger_nav .bar3{width: 35px;height: 5px;background-color: #333;margin: 6px 6px}#nav .burger_nav .bar1{transform: rotate(-45deg) translate(-9px, 6px)}#nav .burger_nav .bar2{opacity:0;}#nav .burger_nav .bar3 {transform: rotate(45deg) translate(-8px, -8px)}#content{margin-left:50px;margin-top:-30px}#burger_check:checked+#nav{display:block;left:0;top:0;width:100%;z-index:1}}</style><label class=\"burger_nav\" for=\"burger_check\"><div class=\"bar1\"></div><div class=\"bar2\"></div><div class=\"bar3\"></div></label><input id=\"burger_check\" type=\"checkbox\"/><ul id=\"nav\"><label class=\"burger_nav\" for=\"burger_check\"><div class=\"bar1\"></div><div class=\"bar2\"></div><div class=\"bar3\"></div></label><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/\">Home</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danschat356lctri3zavzh6fbxg2a7lo6z3etgkctzzpspewu7zdsaqd.onion\">Chat</a></li><li><a href=\"http://donionsixbjtiohce24abfgsffo2l4tk26qx464zylumgejukfq2vead.onion/test.php\">Online-Test</a></li><li><a href=\"http://donionsixbjtiohce24abfgsffo2l4tk26qx464zylumgejukfq2vead.onion/onions.php\">Onion link list</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/mail/index.php\">E-Mail + XMPP</a></li><li><a href=\"http://dhosting4xxoydyaivckq7tsmtgi4wfs3flpeyitekkmqwu4v4r46syd.onion\">Hosting</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/tutorials/index.php\">Tutorials</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/faq.php\">FAQ</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/about.php\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/privacy.php\">Privacy policy</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/contact.php\">Contact</a></li></ul><div id=\"content\"><p>You can send me a message here. Don't forget to leave a contact option, if you want me to answer.</p>\n<form action=\"/contact.php\" method=\"POST\">\n<p>Name: <br/><input autofocus=\"\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" size=\"30\" value=\"\"/></p>\n<p>Subject: <br/><input name=\"betr\" size=\"30\" value=\"\"/></p>\n<p>Message: <br/><textarea cols=\"30\" id=\"msg\" name=\"msg\" required=\"\" rows=\"5\"></textarea></p>\n<label><input name=\"accept_privacy\" required=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"/>I have read and agreed to the <a href=\"/privacy.php\" target=\"_blank\">Privacy Policy</a></label><br/>\n<input name=\"action\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Send\"/></form><br/>\n<p>If you want to encrypt your message, you can use <a href=\"pgp.txt\" target=\"_blank\">my public PGP key</a>.</p>\n<p>If you prefer to directly get in contact with me, send me an email to <a href=\"mailto:daniel@danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion\">daniel@danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion</a> or <a href=\"mailto:daniel@danwin1210.me\">daniel@danwin1210.me</a>.</p>\n<p><b>Daniel Winzen</b><br/>Steinkaulstraße 47<br/>52070 Aachen<br/>Germany<br/>E-Mail: daniel@danwin1210.me<br/>Tel: +4917698819809</p>\n<b>Disclaimer - External links</b>\n<p>This website contains links to third party websites (\"external links\"). These websites are subject to the liability of the respective operator. When linking first time third-party content, the provider checked whether there are any legal violations. At the time there were none legal violations evident. The provider has no influence on the current and future design and the content of the linked pages. Setting external links does not mean that the provider claims ownership of the content behind the reference or link. Constant control of the external links are not reasonable for the provider without concrete evidence of legal violations. At knowledge of legal violations, however, such external links will be deleted immediately.</p>\n</div>\n</body></html>\n",
  "Daniel - Contact",
