=\"bar3\"></div></label><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/\">Home</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danschat356lctri3zavzh6fbxg2a7lo6z3etgkctzzpspewu7zdsaqd.onion\">Chat</a></li><li><a href=\"http://donionsixbjtiohce24abfgsffo2l4tk26qx464zylumgejukfq2vead.onion/test.php\">Online-Test</a></li><li><a href=\"http://donionsixbjtiohce24abfgsffo2l4tk26qx464zylumgejukfq2vead.onion/onions.php\">Onion link list</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/mail/index.php\">E-Mail + XMPP</a></li><li><a href=\"http://dhosting4xxoydyaivckq7tsmtgi4wfs3flpeyitekkmqwu4v4r46syd.onion\">Hosting</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/tutorials/index.php\">Tutorials</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/faq.php\">FAQ</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/about.php\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/privacy.php\">Privacy policy</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/contact.php\">Contact</a></li></ul><div id=\"content\"><p>You can send me a message here. Don't forget to leave a contact option, if you want me to answer.</p>\n<form action=\"/contact.php\" method=\"POST\">\n<p>Name: <br/><input autofocus=\"\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" size=\"30\" value=\"\"/></p>\n<p>Subject: <br/><input name=\"betr\" size=\"30\" value=\"\"/></p>\n<p>Message: <br/><textarea cols=\"30\" id=\"msg\" name=\"msg\" required=\"\" rows=\"5\"></textarea></p>\n<label><input name=\"accept_privacy\" required=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"/>I have read and agreed to the <a href=\"/privacy.php\" target=\"_blank\">Privacy Policy</a></label><br/>\n<input name=\"action\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Send\"/></form><br/>\n<p>If you want to encrypt your message, you can use