tion to satisfy all your anonymous culinary needs.\">Food and cooking</a>\n<span class=\"qa-nav-cat-note\">(136)</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"qa-nav-cat-item qa-nav-cat-sad-times\">\n<a class=\"qa-nav-cat-link\" href=\"./sad-times\" title=\"Something wrong chum? Post a **question** about it.\">Sad times</a>\n<span class=\"qa-nav-cat-note\">(776)</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"qa-nav-cat-item qa-nav-cat-other\">\n<a class=\"qa-nav-cat-link\" href=\"./other\" title=\"Category for questions that defy categorization. How ironic!\">Other</a>\n<span class=\"qa-nav-cat-note\">(13,449)</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"qa-nav-cat-clear\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qa-main\">\n<div class=\"qa-main-heading\">\n<a href=\"./feed/qa.rss\" title=\"Recent questions and answers\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"qa-rss-icon\" height=\"16\" src=\"./qa-theme/Snow/images/rss.jpg\" width=\"16\"/></a>\n<h1>\nRecent questions and answers\n</h1>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qa-part-q-list\">\n<form action=\"./\" method=\"post\">\n<div class=\"qa-q-list\">\n<div class=\"qa-q-list-item qa-q-list-item-featured\" id=\"q329138\">\n<div class=\"qa-q-item-stats\">\n<div class=\"qa-voting qa-voting-updown\" id=\"voting_329138\">\n<div class=\"qa-vote-buttons qa-vote-buttons-updown\">\n<input class=\"qa-vote-first-button qa-vote-up-button\" name=\"vote_329138_1_q329138\" onclick=\"return qa_vote_click(this);\" title=\"Click to vote up\" type=\"submit\" value=\"+\"/>\n<input class=\"qa-vote-second-button qa-vote-down-button\" name=\"vote_329138_-1_q329138\" onclick=\"return qa_vote_click(this);\" title=\"Click to vote down\" type=\"submit\" value=\"–\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qa-vote-count qa-vote-count-updown\">\n<span class=\"qa-upvote-count\">\n<span class=\"qa-upvote-count-data\">3</span><span class=\"qa-upvote-count-pad\"> like</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"qa-downvote-count\">\n<span class=\"qa-downvote-count-data\">0</span><span class=\"qa-downvote-count-pad\"> dislike</span>\n</span>\n</div>\