n</div>\n<div class=\"qa-vote-count qa-vote-count-updown\">\n<span class=\"qa-upvote-count\">\n<span class=\"qa-upvote-count-data\">0</span><span class=\"qa-upvote-count-pad\"> like</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"qa-downvote-count\">\n<span class=\"qa-downvote-count-data\">1</span><span class=\"qa-downvote-count-pad\"> dislike</span>\n</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qa-vote-clear\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"qa-a-count\">\n<span class=\"qa-a-count-data\">5</span><span class=\"qa-a-count-pad\"> answers</span>\n</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qa-q-item-main\">\n<div class=\"qa-q-item-title\">\n<a href=\"./329207/nicotine-effects\"><span title=\"i smoke and vape but its come to the point where i literally dont feel anything anymore. i vape everyday with the highest nic concentration (50 nic), and ill take 20 puffs and wont feel anything unless i take a tolerance break for a few days. i dont want to stop for a while but is there any way i can make it feel better or hit harder like when i first started? those buzzes were so good, i dont even remember the last time i had a proper buzz. thanks :)\">Nicotine effects</span></a>\n</div>\n<span class=\"qa-q-item-avatar-meta\">\n<span class=\"qa-q-item-meta\">\n<a class=\"qa-q-item-what\" href=\"./329207/nicotine-effects?show=329510#a329510\">answered</a>\n<span class=\"qa-q-item-when\">\n<span class=\"qa-q-item-when-data\">13 hours</span><span class=\"qa-q-item-when-pad\"> ago</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"qa-q-item-where\">\n<span class=\"qa-q-item-where-pad\">in </span><span class=\"qa-q-item-where-data\"><a class=\"qa-category-link\" href=\"./drugs\">Recreational drugs</a></span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"qa-q-item-who\">\n<span class=\"qa-q-item-who-pad\">by </span>\n<span class=\"qa-q-item-who-data\"><a class=\"qa-user-link\" href=\"./user/Nikola\">Nikola</a></span>\n<span class=\"qa-q-item-who-title\">N00b 101</span>\n<span class=\"qa-q-item-who-points\">\n<span class=\"qa-q-item-who-points-pad\">(</span><span class=\"qa-q-item-who-points-data\">100</span><span class=\"qa-q-item-who-points-pad\"> points)</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"qa-q-item-who-pad\"> </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qa-q-item-clear\">\n</div>\n</div> <!-- END qa-q-list-item -->\n<div class=\"qa-q-list-item\" id=\"q329418\">\n<div class=\"qa-q-item-stats\">\n<div class=\"qa-voting qa-voting-updown\" id=\"voting_329418\">\n<div class=\"qa-vote-buttons qa-vote-buttons-updown\">\n<input class=\"qa-vote-first-button qa-vote-up-button\" name=\"vote_329418_1_q329418\" onclick=\"return qa_vote_click(this);\" title=\"Click to vote up\" type=\"submit\" value=\"+\"/>\n<input class=\"qa-vote-second-button qa-vote-down-button\" name=\"vote_329418_-1_q329418\" onclick=\"return qa_vote_click(this);\" title=\"Click to vote down\" type=\"submit\" value=\"–\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qa-vote-count qa-vote-count-updown\">\n<span class=\"qa-upvote-count\">\n<span class=\"qa-upvote-count-data\">1</span><span class=\"qa-upvote-count-pad\"> like</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"qa-downvote-count\">\n<span class=\"qa-downvote-count-data\">0</span><span class=\"qa-downvote-count-pad\"> dislike</span>\n</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qa-vote-clear\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"qa-a-count\">\n<span class=\"qa-a-count-data\">1</span><span class=\"qa-a-count-pad\"> answer</span>\n</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qa-q-item-main\">\n<div class=\"qa-q-item-title\">\n<a href=\"./329418/anonymity-enhancing-actions-deleting-metadata-digital-pictures\"><span title=\"I already know how to edit the metadata of digital media. But beyond that, I learned that a lot of data hiding is possible with steganography. Anyway, To give an example, I downloaded a meme from chan. I deleted all the metadata. I named it randomly. And then what more can I do for anonymity?\">What other anonymity-enhancing actions can be taken beyond deleting the metadata of digital media such as pictures, videos?</span></a>\n</div>\n<span class=\"qa-q-item-avat