.com/docs/installing-running-nss -->\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer-col footer-col-2\"><ul class=\"social-media-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TheTorProject/\"><svg class=\"svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"/assets/minima-social-icons.svg#github\"></use></svg> <span class=\"username\">TheTorProject</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/freenet/\"><svg class=\"svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"/assets/minima-social-icons.svg#github\"></use></svg> <span class=\"username\">freenet</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/i2p/\"><svg class=\"svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"/assets/minima-social-icons.svg#github\"></use></svg> <span class=\"username\">i2p</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer-col footer-col-3\">\n<p>Tor, I2P, Freenet and Free-Speech.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
