  "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<head>\n<title>cathugger's site</title>\n<style type=\"text/css\">\nhtml {\n\t/* background: url('bg.png') repeat; */\n\tbackground-color: #bff2ad;\n\tcolor: black;\n\tfont-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n}\na:hover {\n\tbackground-color: #76c482;\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<hr/>\n<div style=\"float:left;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"neko2.png\"/>\n<!-- original: kalmia.png / 19532236_p0.jpg -->\n</div>\n<div>\n<h2>Projects</h2>\n<h3>mkp224o - vanity address generator for v3 (ed25519) onion services</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/cathugger/mkp224o\">GitHub</a></p>\n<h3>dirserver - hacky caching autoindexer (is used for files/)</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/cathugger/dirserver\">GitHub</a></p>\n<hr/>\n<a href=\"files/\">files</a> (currently disconnected, will be back once quarantine ends)\n<hr/>\n<a href=\"contact.html\">contact / keys / donate</a>\n<hr/>\n<a href=\"old.html\">old site w/ some random stuff I share</a>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n<hr/>\n<span><a href=\"http://cathugger.i2p\">i2p</a>[<a href=\"http://cathugger.i2p/?i2paddresshelper=peHwDohld8htRAZpaaX-YIpm5bmWsCYw9Z5r9NmakaNbVMUp0j58dmx91XnqzHeeZnZ2mXGeYA0AnRPkVVqeZXCBe63J~1NNfyLyQ7GmSsNOjmpCsulT3PatJ503hie~hU1xhMM5FCBmY4i91f6rpjJ8DmLHIHzEyAqvBsSe~5wu7f7mcZ4VauC4ATKMpovu2hBRMwa8DnVRFWzuxT432ItkpdJRz0ycvBkAgivPPKL1MdA1NsU1MSCXmylHWTocaoUQXq84uMXYdyShmu~VhV862ybgxsAjAmtTS9USqtra1H49t5bliHIrLd7MBh2jWL7yZsK5ThYfM4kcm7~NK5~4YbVDjRR0U96Dwv6EvrJHkPCgNcYaEnSQGMrDXabVh5PrvY0LNBTgSHDeOrJbulZZxxd-2i9eAE520nAybhyNfQ94mjCLkvxP57nfWqqLCEm29OpXoZrGNK51xO8ku6SeAuaPwfdKndd2jcBzPTqJnccz-15GDhHNACnSlP3rBQAEAAcAAA==\">h</a>|<a href=\"http://vq43xjjcnejqpzfprws5qzrea2siieshu4tglpdepql2w3w3bpba.b32.i2p\">b</a>]\n<a href=\"http://cathug2kyi4ilneggumrenayhuhsvrgn6qv2y47bgeet42iivkpynqad.onion\">onion</a><!--/<a href=\"http://loli3jjm7joz4yow.onion\">onion v2</a>-->\n<a href=\"http://cathugger.ano\">anonet</a>[<a href=\"ht