\"><h1 id=\"chatname\">Daniel's Chat</h1><form action=\"/chat.php\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"post\" target=\"_parent\"><input name=\"lang\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"en\"/><input name=\"nc\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"900522\"/><input name=\"action\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"login\"/><table><tr><td>Nickname:</td><td><input autofocus=\"\" name=\"nick\" size=\"15\" type=\"text\"/></td></tr><tr><td>Password:</td><td><input name=\"pass\" size=\"15\" type=\"password\"/></td></tr><tr id=\"captcha\"><td>Copy:<br/><img height=\"24\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhNwAYAIAAAAQCBPz+/CwAAAAANwAYAAACbISPqcvtD6OctNqLs968+w+GThAgpEieUHqon+o2aQnEXGwrs3HipV+j8X7C4KNHNLZoMGFzaCoukEbg0LaDLo9MllWbAFJHzjE4u3Q1c+Fy96pVv+PSaVGeFN/dP4yULcKFFkhYaHiImBhRAAA7\" width=\"55\"/></td><td><input name=\"challenge\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"202451452\"/><input autocomplete=\"off\" name=\"captcha\" required=\"\" size=\"15\" type=\"text\"/></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\">Guests, choose a colour:<br/><select name=\"colour\"><option value=\"\">* Random Colour *</option><option style=\"color:#F5F5DC;\" value=\"F5F5DC\">Beige</option><option style=\"color:#8A2BE2;\" value=\"8A2BE2\">Blue violet</option><option style=\"color:#A52A2A;\" value=\"A52A2A\">Brown</option><option style=\"color:#00FFFF;\" value=\"00FFFF\">Cyan</option><option style=\"color:#00BFFF;\" value=\"00BFFF\">Sky blue</option><option style=\"color:#FFD700;\" value=\"FFD700\">Gold</option><option style=\"color:#808080;\" value=\"808080\">Grey</option><option style=\"color:#008000;\" value=\"008000\">Green</option><option style=\"color:#FF69B4;\" value=\"FF69B4\">Hot pink</option><option style=\"color:#ADD8E6;\" value=\"ADD8E6\">Light blue</option><option style=\"color:#90EE90;\" value=\"90EE90\">Light green</option><option style=\"color:#32CD32;\" value=\"32CD32\">Lime green</option><option style=\"color:#FF00FF;\" value=\"FF00FF\">Magenta</option><option style=\"color:#808000;\" value=\"808000\">Olive</option><option style=\"color:#FFA500;\" value=\"FFA500\">Orange</option><option style=\"color:#FF4500;\" value=\"FF4500\">Orange red</option><option style=\"color:#FF0000;\" value=\"FF0000\">Red</option><option style=\"color:#4169E1;\" value=\"4169E1\">Royal blue</option><option style=\"color:#2E8B57;\" value=\"2E8B57\">Sea green</option><option style=\"color:#A0522D;\" value=\"A0522D\">Sienna</option><option style=\"color:#C0C0C0;\" value=\"C0C0C0\">Silver</option><option style=\"color:#D2B48C;\" value=\"D2B48C\">Tan</option><option style=\"color:#008080;\" value=\"008080\">Teal</option><option style=\"color:#EE82EE;\" value=\"EE82EE\">Violet</option><option style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\" value=\"FFFFFF\">White</option><option style=\"color:#FFFF00;\" value=\"FFFF00\">Yellow</option><option style=\"color:#9ACD32;\" value=\"9ACD32\">Yellow green</option></select></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><input type=\"submit\" value=\"Enter Chat\"/></td></tr></table></form><div id=\"chatters\">Currently 13 chatter(s) in room:<br/><span style=\"color:#ff79ff;font-family:'Fantasy','Futura','Papyrus';font-style:italic;\">Catty</span>   <span style=\"color:#989898;font-size:smaller;\">span</span>   <span style=\"color:#00bfff;\">Curious</span>   <span style=\"color:#80ffff;\">M</span>   <span style=\"color:#8425E2;\">Bob2</span>   <span style=\"color:#FF00FF;\">RemyLeBeau</span>   <span style=\"color:#E3AA8F;\">Eric</span>   <span style=\"color:#2E911C;\">ytryrty</span>   <span style=\"color:#5864DF;\">54uiz</span>   <span style=\"color:#CFC24B;\">jeff</span>   <span style=\"color:#2B7552;\">Cola</span>   <span style=\"color:#72E5C6;\">fitt</span>   <span style=\"color:#A2431B;\">fuvjyou</span>   </div><br/><div id=\"topic\">Dan's Chat | !help for Help | !rules for Rules</div><div id=\"rules\"><h2>Rules</h2><b>By entering you agree to these terms of service: <br/><br/>1.) No links to any pornography, gore/corpses, violence, zoophilia, human trafficking or illegal markets, asking for it may result in kick.<br/>2.) Be respectful towards other chatters. No flaming, bigotry, or harassment.<br/>3.) Don't scam, spam, or post info that endangers anyone's anonymity or safety.<br/>4.) Don't discuss or engage in the attacking of members, guests, sites or services.<br/><br/> We reserve the right to delete your messages / warn you / kick you at any time for breaking these rules as (fairly) laid out.</b></div><p id=\"changelang\">Change language: <a href=\"/chat.php?lang=bg\">Български</a> <a href=\"/chat.php?lang=cz\">čeština</a> <a href=\"/chat.php?lang=de\">Deutsch</a> <a href=\"/chat.php?lang=en\">English</a> <a href=\"/chat.php?lang=es\">Español</a> <a href=\"/chat.php?lang=fr\">Français</a> <a href=\"/chat.php?lang=id\">Bahasa Indonesia</a> <a href=\"/chat.php?lang=it\">Italiano</a> <a href=\"/chat.php?lang=ru\">Русский</a> <a href=\"/chat.php?lang=uk\">Українська</a> <a href=\"/chat.php?lang=zh_CN\">简体中文</a></p><small><br/><br/><a href=\"https://github.com/DanWin/le-chat-php\" target=\"_blank\">LE CHAT-PHP - 1.24</a></small></div></body></html>",
