  "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n<title>Daniel - FAQ - Frequently Asked Questions</title>\n<meta content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Type\"/>\n<meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" name=\"viewport\"/>\n<meta content=\"A list of frequently asked questions regarding the services I provide and their answers\" name=\"description\"/>\n</head><body>\n<div id=\"banner\"><h1>FAQ - Frequently Asked Questions</h1></div>\n<style type=\"text/css\">body{margin:0;font-size:16px}#banner{background:#0000FF;text-align:center}#banner h1{font-size: 24px;color:#FFFFFF;margin:0;padding:17px}#content{margin-left:170px;margin-bottom:30px;padding:5px 5px;word-wrap:break-word;min-height:100vh}#nav{position:absolute;margin-top:0px;padding:0;border:1px solid silver;background-color:#FFFFFF;text-align:left;width:160px}#nav li{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:10px}#nav a{display:block;font-weight:bold}#nav a:link{color:#000000;background-color:#EEEEEE}#nav a:visited{color:#666666;background-color:#EEEEEE}#nav a:hover{color:#000000;background-color:#FFFFFF}#nav a:active{color:#FFFFFF;background-color:#808080}#burger_check{display:none}.table{display:table;width:100%}.row{display:table-row}.cell{border: 1px solid #999999;display:table-cell;padding:3px 3px}.headerrow{display:table-header-group;font-weight:bold}@media (max-width: 768px){body{font-size:18px}#nav{display:none}.burger_nav .bar1,.burger_nav .bar2,.burger_nav .bar3{width: 35px;height: 5px;background-color: #333;margin: 6px 6px}#nav .burger_nav .bar1{transform: rotate(-45deg) translate(-9px, 6px)}#nav .burger_nav .bar2{opacity:0;}#nav .burger_nav .bar3 {transform: rotate(45deg) translate(-8px, -8px)}#content{margin-left:50px;margin-top:-30px}#burger_check:checked+#nav{display:block;left:0;top:0;width:100%;z-index:1}}</style><label class=\"burger_nav\" for=\"burger_check\"><div class=\"bar1\"></div><div class=\"bar2\"></div><div class=\"bar3\"></div></label><input id=\"burger_check\" type=\"checkbox\"/><ul id=\"nav\"><label class=\"burger_nav\" for=\"burger_check\"><div class=\"bar1\"></div><div class=\"bar2\"></div><div class=\"bar3\"></div></label><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/\">Home</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danschat356lctri3zavzh6fbxg2a7lo6z3etgkctzzpspewu7zdsaqd.onion\">Chat</a></li><li><a href=\"http://donionsixbjtiohce24abfgsffo2l4tk26qx464zylumgejukfq2vead.onion/test.php\">Online-Test</a></li><li><a href=\"http://donionsixbjtiohce24abfgsffo2l4tk26qx464zylumgejukfq2vead.onion/onions.php\">Onion link list</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/mail/index.php\">E-Mail + XMPP</a></li><li><a href=\"http://dhosting4xxoydyaivckq7tsmtgi4wfs3flpeyitekkmqwu4v4r46syd.onion\">Hosting</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/tutorials/index.php\">Tutorials</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/faq.php\">FAQ</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/about.php\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/privacy.php\">Privacy policy</a></li><li><a href=\"http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/contact.php\">Contact</a></li></ul><div id=\"content\"><p>Here you have a list of frequently asked questions regarding the services I provide and their answers.</p>\n<small>Lang: <a href=\"/faq.php\">English</a> <a href=\"/faq_ru.php\">Русский</a></small><br/><br/>\n<div class=\"table\">\n<div class=\"headerrow\"><div class=\"cell\">Question</div><div class=\"cell\">Answer</div></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"cell\">How can I become a member in your chat?</div><div class=\"cell\">You have to follow the rules and return to the chat from time to time and not just get a member status to never come back. If you are comfortable with that, just ask me, daniel, to add you. If I am not in the chat, you can also send me your desired Nickname and Password via the <a href=\"contact.php\">contact form</a> and I'll add you as soon, as I am online.</div></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"cell\">Why was my file/link/message/site removed?</div><div class=\"cell\">You probably didn't obey the rules which are stated on the upload page.</div></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"cell\">I found an illegal link/file on your site, can you remove it?</div><div class=\"cell\">Yes, please <a href=\"contact.php\">report it</a> and I will remove it as soon as possible.</div></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"cell\">What is PGP?</div><div class=\"cell\">PGP is an encryption standard, that can be used to encrypt or sign emails and files. <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pretty_Good_Privacy\">More info in this Wikipedia article</a>.</div></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"cell\">I have an idea how to make your site better, can you add feature xyz?</div><div class=\"cell\">Yes, please <a href=\"contact.php\">contact me</a> and I may add it on my ToDo list. It might take a while until your feature gets added though.</div></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"cell\">I want to translate your chat script into another language, how can I do this?</div><div class=\"cell\">Please <a href=\"https://github.com/DanWin/le-chat-php\">download</a> the source and copy read the Translate section of the README file.</div></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"cell\">I heard of red rooms, live murder streams or similar. Are they real?</div><div class=\"cell\">No, they are just horror stories people commonly tell you. Many people make YouTube videos about the \"deep web\" and claim there were sites like these. However many scammers jump on the train and create a site where they tell you to pay bitcoins. When you pay the price, they would give you access to a red room or similar. Don't pay, because they simply do not exist.</div></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"cell\">I heard of the shadow web, marianas web or closed shell network. How can I access them?</div><div class=\"cell\">You can't, because they do not exist. Some scammers want to sell it to you though. Don't pay because you won't get anyting in return for your money.</div></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"cell\">Isn't the dark net supposed to be scarry and full of creepy shit? Why can't I find any interesting sites?</div><div class=\"cell\">No, the tor darknet was created to be able to anonymously browse the internet, circumvent censorship and anonymously host websites. Of couse it's not only used for a good cause. There are many phishing sites, scammers and child porn sites. But appart from the fact that you are anonymous, there isn't that much of a difference to the clearnet (normal internet). So most horror stories you have heard about tor are just that, stories.</div></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"cell\">What's the difference between deep web and darknet?</div><div class=\"cell\">The deep web is any site that can't be indexed by a search engine, so basically any site where you have to log in or be part of a private network. To access a darknet, it requires special software like tor, i2p or freenet. The darknet is a small part of the deep web.</div></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"cell\">I have more Questions.</div><div class=\"cell\">Feel free, to <a href=\"contact.php\">contact me</a>.</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</body></html>\n",
  "Daniel - FAQ - Frequently Asked Questions",
  "http://danielas3rtn54uwmofdo3x2bsdifr47huasnmbgqzfrec5ubupvtpid.onion/faq.php"
]
