12.031,18,12.695,18,13.516L18,13.516z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span>\n</label>\n<div class=\"trigger\"><a class=\"page-link\" href=\"/about/\">About</a> <a class=\"page-link\" href=\"/mirrors/\">Mirrors</a> </div>\n</nav></div>\n</header>\n<main aria-label=\"Content\" class=\"page-content\">\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\n<div class=\"home\">\n<h2 class=\"post-list-heading\">Posts</h2>\n<ul class=\"post-list\"><li><span class=\"post-meta\">Sep 20, 2018</span>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"post-link\" href=\"/2018/09/20/hidden-services-howto.html\">\n              Hidden Services HowTo\n            </a>\n</h3></li><li><span class=\"post-meta\">Sep 21, 2018</span>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"post-link\" href=\"/2018/09/21/create-gce-vm.html\">\n              Creating A GCE VM\n            </a>\n</h3></li><li><span class=\"post-meta\">Sep 21, 2018</span>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"post-link\" href=\"/2018/09/21/create-jekyll-site.html\">\n              Creating A Jekyll Site\n            </a>\n</h3></li><li><span class=\"post-meta\">Sep 22, 2018</span>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"post-link\" href=\"/2018/09/22/install-lighttpd.html\">\n              Installing Lighttpd Service\n            </a>\n</h3></li><li><span class=\"post-meta\">Sep 22, 2018</span>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"post-link\" href=\"/2018/09/22/install-noip.html\">\n              Installing NoIP Service\n            </a>\n</h3></li><li><span class=\"post-meta\">Sep 23, 2018</span>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"post-link\" href=\"/2018/09/23/install-i2p.html\">\n              Installing I2P Service\n            </a>\n</h3></li><li><span class=\"post-meta\">Sep 24, 2018</span>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"post-link\" href=\"/2018/09/24/install-tor.html\">\n              Installing TOR Service\n            </a>\n</h3></li><li><span class=\"post-meta\">Sep 25, 2018</span>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"post-link\" href=\"/2018/09/25/install-freenet.html\">\n              Installing Freenet Service\n            </a>\n</h3></li><li><span class=\"post-meta\">Jun 2, 2019</span>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"post-link\" href=\"/2019/06/02/host-onion-android.html\">\n              Host Onion Service from Android\n            </a>\n</h3></li></ul>\n<p class=\"rss-subscribe\">subscribe <a href=\"/feed.xml\">via RSS</a></p></div>\n</div>\n</main><footer class=\"site-footer h-card\">\n<data class=\"u-url\" href=\"/\"></data>\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\n<h2 class=\"footer-heading\">Clearnet / Darknet Mirrors</h2>\n<div class=\"footer-col-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"footer-col footer-col-1\">\n<ul class=\"contact-list\">\n<li><a class=\"u-email\" href=\"https://dwghp.ddns.net/\">Off-site</a> (hosted clearnet)</li>\n<li><a class=\"u-email\" href=\"http://dwblog.ddns.net/\">On-site</a> (self-hosted clearnet)</li>\n<li><a class=\"u-email\" href=\"http://bithxedusrw236ji.onion/\">onion</a> (Tor darknet)</li>\n<li><a class=\"u-email\" href=\"http://127.0.0.1:8888/freenet:USK@UHw2~SAEv7EAmfhb4SO6EVLWRo6NHbKUte-BJ72isCg,v6y94~qHCRvfKdM-90dxC2rHSvykgyEYoZLp45a26NU,AQACAAE/dwblog/13/\">freesite</a> (Freenet darknet)</li>\n<li><a class=\"u-email\" href=\"http://lggg5usmc5jrle6pxjb7zysnorlp6djzu7ne36geigbcigwfugma.b32.i2p/\">eepsite (b32)</a> (I2P darknet)</li>\n<!-- <li><a class=\"u-email\" href=\"http://dwblog.i2p/\">eepsite (i2p)</a> (I2P darknet)</li> -->\n<!-- <li><a class=\"u-email\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/2/https://dwghp.ddns.net/\">Web-Archive</a> (of off-site host)</li> -->\n<!-- <li><a class=\"u-email\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/2/http://dwblog.ddns.net/\">Web-Archive</a> (of on-site host)</li> -->\n<!-- todo Tor2Web -->\n<!-- onion.ws     - fast - 1.9k goog -->\n<!-- onion.sh     - slow - 4.6k -->\n<!-- onion.link   - slow - 73.4k (wa-ok) -->\n<!-- i2p.xyz      - ???? - 16.4k (wa-ok) -->\n<!-- Zeronet public proxy -->\n<!-- https://www.zerogate.tk/1HeLLo4uzjaLetFx6NH3PMwFP3qbRbTf3D/ -->\n<!-- https://zero.acelewis.com/ -->\n<!-- https://www.zerogate.tk/kaffiene.bit -->\n<!-- https://grez911.github.io/zeroproxy.html -->\n<!-- Solid Server -->\n<!-- https://solid.inrupt.com/docs/installing-running-nss -->\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer-col footer-col-2\"><ul class=\"social-media-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TheTorProject/\"><svg class=\"svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"/assets/minima-social-icons.svg#github\"></use></svg> <span class=\"username\">TheTorProject</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/freenet/\"><svg class=\"svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"/assets/minima-social-icons.svg#github\"></use></svg> <span class=\"username\">freenet</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/i2p/\"><svg class=\"svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"/assets/minima-social-icons.svg#github\"></use></svg> <span class=\"username\">i2p</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer-col footer-col-3\">\n<p>Tor, I2P, Freenet and Free-Speech.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
