  "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/loose.dtd\">\n\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-type\"/>\n<link href=\"favicon.ico\" rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/icon\"/>\n<link href=\"favicon.ico\" rel=\"shortcut icon\" type=\"image/icon\"/>\n<title>The Dark Web Pug</title>\n<style type=\"text/css\">\r\nbody\r\n{\r\n\tfont:15px Tahoma, Geneva, Arial, Helvetica, Sans-serif;\r\n\tmargin:0;\r\n\tbackground: #5F9AA8;\r\n\tpadding:0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n.txt\r\n{\r\n\tborder:2px solid #C0C0C0;\r\n\ttext-align: center;\r\n}\r\n\r\ntextarea\r\n{\r\n\tborder:2px solid #C0C0C0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\na:link\r\n{\r\n\tcolor: #CC0000;\r\n\tfont-weight:bold;\r\n\ttext-decoration:none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n#main {\r\nborder:3px solid #D5DDEB;\r\nborder-radius:5px;\r\nmargin:20px auto 30px;\r\npadding:16px 20px 0;\r\nwidth:850px\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"main\">\n<h1>The Dark Web Pug's Ultimate Guide To The Dark Web</h1>\n<img src=\"shocked-pug.jpg\"/>\n<br/><br/>\r\nWelcome to Dark Web Pug's ultimate dark web guide. <br/>\r\nOn the internet no one knows you are a dog! <br/>\n<br/>\r\nLet's browse some darknet sites?!<br/>\n<br/>\r\nYou are going to need some links. Such wow!<br/>\n<br/>\n<a href=\"http://s4k4ceiapwwgcm3mkb6e4diqecpo7kvdnfr5gg7sph7jjppqkvwwqtyd.onion/\">http://s4k4ceiapwwgcm3mkb6e4diqecpo7kvdnfr5gg7sph7jjppqkvwwqtyd.onion/</a> OnionLinks v3 <br/>\n<a href=\"http://6nhmgdpnyoljh5uzr5kwlatx2u3diou4ldeommfxjz3wkhalzgjqxzqd.onion/\">http://6nhmgdpnyoljh5uzr5kwlatx2u3diou4ldeommfxjz3wkhalzgjqxzqd.onion/</a> The Hidden Wiki  <br/>\n<a href=\"http://2jwcnprqbugvyi6ok2h2h7u26qc6j5wxm7feh3znlh2qu3h6hjld4kyd.onion/\">http://2jwcnprqbugvyi6ok2h2h7u26qc6j5wxm7feh3znlh2qu3h6hjld4kyd.onion/</a> Another Hidden Wiki  <br/>\n<br/>\r\nJust choose one of the hidden wiki sites to get started<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\nNow let's get Pug some weed!<br/>\n<br/>\n<img src=\"pugstoned.jpg\"/>